This mod builds on the work of others:

Combat Rebalanced by TakeyaSaito, MIT License.
The idea of freeing block and dodge during melee attacks, and the byte pattern that finds the
game's hit code (native/warriors-poise-native/dllmain.cpp), come from this mod.

ShroudForge by bonsaibauer, MIT License. https://github.com/bonsaibauer/shroudforge
The mod runs on this loader, and the way the DLL reads the game's entity layout follows its
runtime profiles.

